# 42 — Bring GitHub, Reddit and documentation knowledge into Hivemind

**Project:** Bring GitHub, Reddit and documentation knowledge into Hivemind

**Goal:** Build a maintained, provenance-aware Hivemind intake for selected GitHub issues, Reddit discussions and public documentation so agents can benefit from knowledge across the internet.

**Status:** queued

**Owner:** Unassigned

**Estimate:** TBD

**Waiting on:** owner/scope agreement; source and dependency checks

**Start:** [Astrid development skill](../../skills/astrid-dev/SKILL.md) and [shared run contract](../../skills/astrid-dev-shared/run-contract.md). [Inputs](inputs.md) · [Tasks](tasks.md). The [catalog](../index.md) owns priority, status and owner.

**Vision gaps:** [CI-003 — Bring GitHub, Reddit and documentation knowledge into Hivemind](../../vision/gaps/CI-003-public-source-ingestion.md) (primary).

## Goal and scope

Build a maintained, provenance-aware Hivemind intake for selected GitHub issues, Reddit discussions and public documentation so agents can benefit from knowledge across the internet.

**Included:** Permitted source connectors, incremental refresh, revisions, deduplication, attribution, source removal and evidence-quality labels.

**Boundary:** No indiscriminate crawling or private-source scraping. Treat public text as untrusted content, not instructions.

## What this builds on

[Plan 22 Hivemind protocol](../22-hivemind-protocol/plan.md) and [Plan 23 agent learning](../23-agent-learning-integration/plan.md). These are foundations to verify at current source revisions, not proof of a deployed result. Prefer reusing them over inventing another runtime or state owner.

## Proposed sequence

1. Audit allowed APIs, licensing, retention and current ingestion paths.
2. Ingest authorized GitHub, Reddit and documentation examples with revision/provenance.
3. Prove refresh, deduplication, deletion, stale/conflicting evidence and rate-limit behavior.
4. Have agents use the resulting knowledge on real tasks and compare against raw search, including injection negatives.

## Interfaces and handoff

Before product work, pin actual accepted base/donor revisions, implementation owners and dependencies. Consume existing pack/component/project contracts; produce a tested contract or working artifact and link exact product PRs. Never infer authorization from a draft.

## Completion

Have agents use the resulting knowledge on real tasks and compare against raw search, including injection negatives. Record integrated candidate identity, real creator/agent outcomes and meaningful negative cases. Completion does not automatically close the associated vision gap.

**Authorization:** Draft, unassigned, queued. Owner decision and focused checks are required before implementation.
